{"term":{"iri":"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/SO_0000395","compactId":"SO_0000395","id":"SO:0000395","label":"U5_snRNA","definition":{"text":"U5 RNA is a component of both types of known spliceosome. The precise function of this molecule is unknown, though it is known that the 5' loop is required for splice site selection and p220 binding, and that both the 3' stem-loop and the Sm site are important for Sm protein binding and cap methylation.","xrefs":["http://www.sanger.ac.uk/cgi-bin/Rfam/getacc?RF00020"]},"comments":[],"synonyms":[{"scope":"exact","value":"U5 small nuclear RNA"},{"scope":"exact","value":"U5 snRNA"},{"scope":"exact","value":"small nuclear RNA U5"},{"scope":"exact","value":"snRNA U5"}],"xrefs":["http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/U5_snRNA"],"subsets":["SOFA"],"altIds":[],"namespace":"sequence","isObsolete":false,"replacedBy":[],"canonicalUrl":"/browser/current_release/term/SO:0000395/","history":{"firstSeen":{"hash":"92e3cae9f3d39e5979110bad332c5fadf7a4b3ab","shortHash":"92e3cae","date":"2016-12-05","subject":"Add renamed SO files"},"mostRecent":{"hash":"92e3cae9f3d39e5979110bad332c5fadf7a4b3ab","shortHash":"92e3cae","date":"2016-12-05","subject":"Add renamed SO files"},"entries":[{"hash":"92e3cae9f3d39e5979110bad332c5fadf7a4b3ab","shortHash":"92e3cae","date":"2016-12-05","subject":"Add renamed SO files"}]},"parents":["SO:0000274"],"children":[],"ancestors":["SO:0000274","SO:0002247","SO:0000655","SO:0000233","SO:0000673","SO:0000831","SO:0001411","SO:0000001","SO:0000110"],"descendants":[],"relationships":[],"graphNeighborhood":{"parents":["http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/SO_0000274"],"children":[],"related":[]}},"graph":{"parents":[{"iri":"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/SO_0000274","id":"SO:0000274","label":"snRNA"}],"children":[],"related":[]}}